    <statement><p>Find the linearization <m>L(x,y)</m> of the <m>f(x,y) = x^3 y^{5}</m> at the point <m>(2,2)</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <m>L(x,y) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>384\mathopen{}\left(x-2\right)+640\mathopen{}\left(y-2\right)+256</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
